{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Fox-Fire|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Ahri
|skill        = W
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Ahri''' gains {{sti|{{as|40% '''bonus''' movement speed}}}} that decays over 2 seconds and conjures three flames which orbit her clockwise for up to {{fd|2.5}} seconds.
|description2 = After {{fd|0.25}} seconds of the cast, each flame targets a {{tip|sight|visible}} enemy based on priority, or after {{fd|0.4}} seconds, simply targets the closest visible enemy in range. Each flame deals {{as|magic damage}}, with subsequent flames against a target dealing 40% damage.
|leveling2    = {{st|Primary Magic Damage|{{ap|40 to 120}} {{as|(+ 40% AP)}}|Subsequent Magic Damage|{{ap|40*0.4 to 120*0.4}} {{as|(+ {{ap|40*0.4}}% AP)}}|Total Single-Target Damage|{{ap|40*(1+0.4*2) to 120*(1+0.4*2)}} {{as|(+ {{ap|40*(1+0.4*2)}}% AP)}}}}
|description3 = Flames prioritize enemy champions hit by ''{{ai|Charm|Ahri}}'', then enemy {{tip|champion|champions}}, then minions that would die to ''Fox-Fire's'' damage, and then the target of '''Ahri's''' last basic attack within 3 seconds.
|description4 = ''Fox-Fire's'' damage is doubled against {{tip|minions}} below {{sti|{{as|20% '''maximum''' health}}}}.
|leveling4    = {{st|Primary Minion Damage|{{ap|40*2 to 120*2}} {{as|(+ {{ap|40*2}}% AP)}}|Subsequent Minion Damage|{{ap|40*2*0.4 to 120*2*0.4}} {{as|(+ {{ap|40*2*0.4}}% AP)}}}}
